{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a twist of fate, a young man is kidnapped. He was meant to die for a sinister purpose, but he has no intention of letting that happen. Now, his only chance is to use every item and resource he can find to survive. You must uncover hidden objects and unravel the dark secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.poster.avif?t=1759330530\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.webm?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.mp4?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving through the dark corridors is extremely dangerous. The real challenge lies in the constant lack of resources and relentless enemies that never let you rest. Combat demands your full attention and control \u2014 but remember, you don\u2019t always have to fight. Sometimes the only way to survive is to run and hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.poster.avif?t=1759330530\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.webm?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.mp4?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/5e260a753398194ec363b5ad4370a6ee.avif?t=1759330530\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050940?t=1759330530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/3257b65bd0b405d50946a27fc33fa2c602190740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759330530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/c14b5a9d07e58b1872287d52afa38241329720f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759330530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/c14b5a9d07e58b1872287d52afa38241329720f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759330530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a twist of fate, a young man is kidnapped. He was meant to die for a sinister purpose, but he has no intention of letting that happen. Now, his only chance is to use every item and resource he can find to survive. You must uncover hidden objects and unravel the dark secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.poster.avif?t=1759330530\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.webm?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/4fe2e247053af270a4337246fe18847c.mp4?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving through the dark corridors is extremely dangerous. The real challenge lies in the constant lack of resources and relentless enemies that never let you rest. Combat demands your full attention and control \u2014 but remember, you don\u2019t always have to fight. Sometimes the only way to survive is to run and hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.poster.avif?t=1759330530\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.webm?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.mp4?t=1759330530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/5e260a753398194ec363b5ad4370a6ee.avif?t=1759330530\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["Ilya K"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/e659d3289a729390b1fc1cbb8891bd75a7713695/header.jpg?t=1759330530","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i5-750 / AMD Phenom II X4-945</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050940/1341362378/e6a9d36f8fec38da3b6879d6012d939c268e565c/1758918746/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759330527","dash_h2